<figure id="S3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Overview of candidate sets in the GAE-Bench series. For each of the five data sources, we define three types of candidate sets (i.e., <span id="S3.T5.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">state</span>, <span id="S3.T5.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">trajectory</span>, and <span id="S3.T5.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">interval</span>), corresponding to retrieval targets of a single state <math id="S3.T5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, a full trajectory <math id="S3.T5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, and a trajectory subsequence <math id="S3.T5.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tau_{i:j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{i:j}</annotation></semantics></math>. Note that <math id="S3.T5.m8" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tau_{i:j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{i:j}</annotation></semantics></math> can range in length from a single state-action pair to the entire trajectory.</figcaption>
<p id="S3.T5.17" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T5.17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">
<span id="S3.T5.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:312.6pt;height:159.3pt;vertical-align:-77.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="S3.T5.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.T5.17.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
