<span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Action Space:</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">1. click: Simulates a mouse click on the target bounding box.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">2. type: Types the value (str) into the target bounding box.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Positions are represented in relative coordinates within the range [0,1] on the observation screenshot.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Observation 1: </span><span id="A1.T7.15.4.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">[image]
