</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Subtask Performance</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the evaluation of all baseline methods described in Subsection <a href="#S5.SS1" title="5.1 Experimental Setups ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a>, along with our proposed GAE-Retriever, on 12 retrieval subtasks spanning all data sources. Results are given in terms of Recall@1/5/10. Table <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> provides the outcomes under the in-domain setting, while Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> covers the out-of-domain evaluation.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompt List</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section demonstrates the prompts used in the paper.
Table <a href="#A3.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> includes prompts for data annotation such as state description generation, HTML rendering, and silver data generation.
Snippet <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> specifies the action space definitions used for Mind2Web, WebLINX, WebArena, GUIAct, and AutoWebGLM.
Snippets <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> and <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Prompt List ‣ Universal Retrieval for Multimodal Trajectory Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> show the instruction templates used to augment retrieval queries, where <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">description</span> refers to the natural language summary of a trajectory.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Recall@1/5/10 for all methods on each subtask in the in-domain setting.</figcaption>
<div id="A3.T8.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:337.1pt;vertical-align:-167.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-323.4pt,315.9pt) scale(0.3,0.3) ;">
<p id="A3.T8.4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T8.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:991.7pt;height:968.9pt;vertical-align:-482.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Source</span></span>
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(q,\tau_{1:i})\to\tau_{i+1:n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(q,\tau_{1:i})\to\tau_{i+1:n}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T8.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(q,\tau_{i+1:n})\to\tau_{1:i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(q,\tau_{i+1:n})\to\tau_{1:i}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A3.T8.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T8.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="(q,\tau_{1:i})\to s_{i+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(q,\tau_{1:i})\to s_{i+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
